# Never let git "helpfully" rewrite line endings inside a binary. On
# Windows a mis-detected font or image is silently corrupted, and you
# only find out on the day it stops rendering for somebody.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
